WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.322
Dɩt-yãangã ne dĩisã. Yaa kibarã.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.776
Yʋʋm wʋsg sẽn looge, rũmsã sã n da ket n gomda, kom-kɩɩmdã ra yaa toogo.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.792
Zĩigã sẽn da tar kom wakat fãa, la a ra pa rat n tʋm ye, yõk-a lame.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.136
Sã n ka rẽ, mam na n dɩka yãmba.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.320
A ra pa basd a sũur ye.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:45.202
Bɩ d naag taab n bɩɩs pʋʋgo. Mam tʋmda, la yãmb gũuda, la tõnd pʋɩta foom bũmb nins sẽn yi tẽngã zugu, wall bõn-naands nins sẽn yit tẽngre, tɩ f tʋlg n maan ye.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.920
Zĩigã baooda a sẽn be yĩngri, n gãe zĩ-sobendẽ.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:01.498
Gẽesã bʋta bõn-buudu. A sã n wa tigsdẽ, b kõt-a-la sɛbã, la a rɩt-a lame t'a wʋk bõn-buudu.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.472
Yʋʋmd ning sẽn pʋglã, a sũur sãamame n kos tɩ b yiis-a.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.704
Kẽer sã n bʋd bõn-buudã, a yẽgdame, la a yẽgemda.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.200
A ra gũuda a Eli sorẽ wã, n na n maan yel-solemd t'a paam-a.

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.640
Tã-kẽengã leokame n leb n loogame.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.072
Sẽn sɩng ne wakat kãnga, b yetame tɩ zũndã kẽnd yʋngo n kɩdgdẽ, la gɩgemdã gãeeda.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:43.578
Bãngr-gomdã sẽn yaa to-to wã võor wʋmb pa be ye. A kell n kɩsa sɩd t'a Moyiis togsd-b-la koe-noogã.
